<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores in the</p>
<p>Sheffield Shield on Thursday:</p>
<p>In Brisbane (second day) - Queensland 1st innings 206-9</p>
<p>(Geoff Foley 62 not out, Martin Love 46). Tasmania 1st innings</p>
<p>168 (Michael DiVenuto 66, Andrew Bichel 6-63).</p>
